OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits sexual assaults on two
OL,4,Agirls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year-old man has admitted repeated
OL,7,Fsexual assaults on two children.
OL,9,FPaul Allen, from County Down, appeared
OL,10,Fin Downpatrick Crown Court on Tuesday.
OL,11,FHis barrister asked for him to be
OL,12,Fre-arraigned on 13 of the 18 offences
OL,13,Fagainst him.
OL,15,FAllen, with an address at Cherryhill
OL,16,FCrescent in Dundonald, entered guilty
OL,17,Fpleas to a total of 10 offences of
OL,18,Fsexually assaulting the two girls when
OL,19,Fthey were under 13 years old, on dates
OL,20,Fbetween January 2020 and February 2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
